{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/PhkrVnFtAfnF4Lz4gaGmmQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:42.300903+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/PhkrVnFtAfnF4Lz4gaGmmQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/1OUv43he4DCBHF4iby1wZezsBicUQsXtaHlZnFhcWub1wpzGiaIhxYoq9SG2r9VtcQjricoaFPgDKvnmNibWR5yMQZg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1OUv43he4DCBHF4iby1wZezsBicUQsXtaHOBPDoSjMckuMzGWGpE7RKhHuMSZeKQPNAAH4aTcuEW7Dp8UoPyxzgg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>为了共享上海体育大学优质资源，吸引和促进优秀青年学生之间的互动交流，激发优秀青年学子对新闻与传播领域的学习和研究热情，将于2025年7月举办上海体育大学新闻与传播学院2025年优秀本科生暑期夏令营，现面向相关本科培养单位招收学员：</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1OUv43he4DCBHF4iby1wZezsBicUQsXtaHRRtN4WQR1f2blicSDvSNHvouzf4PDqh7fxiamukp7tn3tKsWWqrDNmfw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><span>招收对象</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>1. 全国普通高等院校2026年应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>2. 学习成绩优异，综合测评成绩排名靠前；</span></p><p><span>3. 有新闻学、传播学、广播电视学、英语、汉语国际教育、传媒经济学、国际传播等专业背景并有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的科研潜力；</span></p><p><span>4. 英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>5. 遵守学术道德规范；</span></p><p><span>6. 鼓励具有跨学科知识背景和新闻学背景的优秀学生报名本次暑期夏令营；</span></p><p><span>7. 招募人数根据报名情况择优通过申请。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>活动时间及形式</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span> 活动时间</span></p><p><span>2025年7月6日—2025年7月10日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>活动地点</span></p><p><span>上海市杨浦区</span></p><p><span>恒仁路200号上海体育大学校区内</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>食宿费用</span></p><p><span>活动期间学员的食宿</span><span>由</span></p><p><span>上海体育大学新闻与传播学院统一安排</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>日程安排</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>业界大咖讲座</span></p><p><span>近距离聆听行业专家分享前沿资讯。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>优秀企业参观</span></p><p><span>带领学员赴英雄电竞、青瞳视觉等科技公司，身临其境感受行业领先技术。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>分组主题研讨</span></p><p><span>教授倾囊相授，领导小组进行主题研讨，提供学术选题与职业发展思路。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>材料审核及学员通过申请</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>新闻与传播学院将根据申请人的递交材料进行审核与筛选，最终入选夏令营学员名单将于</span><span><strong><span>6月24日</span></strong></span><span>前在</span><span><strong><span>“上体新传学院”</span></strong></span><span>公众号公布，并会通过电子邮件或电话直接通知本人，通过申请学员需在</span><strong><span><span>6月26日17:00</span></span></strong><span>前确认是否参加，逾期未确认视为放弃，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>申请须知</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>1. 申请截止时间：</span><strong><span><span>2025年6月17日17:00</span></span></strong><span>（以问卷星收到的报名材料为准）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2. 申请提交材料（《申请表》及以下证明材料扫描件按下列清单顺序整合在一个PDF文件中并做好目录）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>材料清单如下：</span></strong></p><p><span>（1）《2025年上海体育大学新闻与传播学院优秀本科生暑期夏令营申请表》（申请表需打印出来并加盖二级学院公章，以扫描件的形式添加在PDF中）；</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1OUv43he4DCBHF4iby1wZezsBicUQsXtaH3P2tmibUTy1QtUlQ0aSv7JA0ypic0YJYB4C1uA6rQ3FHjhS12sPN8qkA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>（2）本科期间成绩单（由学校教务处盖章）与总评成绩排名证明</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）外语水平证明（如：英语四、六级考试成绩，托福成绩或GRE/GMAT成绩等）</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）其他材料（如:发表论文、专利，获奖或资格证书等）</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>（备注：以上材料在暑期夏令营报到当日需要提交纸质版复印件，同时携带原件备查）</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>3. 申请者必须填写该问卷</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/1OUv43he4DDEoUFgP8QcqI6icxTgL0BjqtzAMWfW6tJUEqrUxTkF38hQSRzMiaT4Niap8pEyb4vFjTHLZnVADRwicA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>4. 联系方式：</span></p><p><span>何老师：（021）65507282</span></p><p><span>陈老师：（021）65507335</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>【排版 / 学生会传媒部 刘施嘉】</span></span